["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Kindergarten Growing Pains: Should We Worry?\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-17-unruffled-幼儿园哭着说再见不是适配失败-反而是信任的证明/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">33:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>幼兒園哭著說再見不是適配失敗，反而是信任的證明</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一個孩子被老師評為「領袖」卻天天哭著上學，另一個孩子因為太會「扮演乖孩子」而在家崩潰——兩種表現背後其實是同一件事：孩子在學校扛了很多，回家才敢卸下來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兒童教育</span><span class=\"tag\">分離焦慮</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Am I Messing Up My Kid? with Jenny Slate Purple Noise\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-17-goodinside-她说表演失误从不往心里去-当妈妈却做什么都往心里去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">48:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>她說表演失誤從不往心裡去，當媽媽卻做什麼都往心裡去</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jenny Slate發現，表演時犯錯她能立刻翻篇、毫不內耗，但當媽媽時，哪怕做得很好，她也會把每一刻都當成對自己的審判。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒焦慮</span><span class=\"tag\">自我接納</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Don’t send the police, send Freedom House swoop and scoop Freedom House Ambulance Service\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-17-throughline-美国第一代急救医疗队是匹兹堡黑人社区培训出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1935x1935+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2Fe3%2Fe5%2Fc0af44ec41dea4b145842458034d%2F35d18c21-c972-4491-bcf5-84652a92c86c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">30:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>美國第一代急救醫療隊是匹茲堡黑人社區培訓出來的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">全美第一批真正受過訓練的急救醫護人員，不是來自醫院，而是匹茲堡希爾區一個黑人社區組織，用退役警車改裝救護車，靠自己的社區信任撐起了全國 EMS 體系的雛形。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國黑人歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">急救醫療</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Introducing… Are we Doomed? Just a Minor Sun Explosion coronal mass ejection (CME) geomagnetic storm black swan event\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-17-cautionary-1859年太阳一次耀斑差点烧毁全球电网-而我们比当时更脆弱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/46364baa48914de6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">37:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>1859年太陽一次耀斑差點燒燬全球電網，而我們比當時更脆弱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">太陽級大型磁暴每150到200年就會發生一次，我們現在欠了一次賬；但對付它的辦法出奇地簡單——提前幾小時把設備關掉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太陽磁暴</span><span class=\"tag\">電網安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"紀錄片導演陳曉卿×羅永浩！他一直被命運推著，卻走出了自己的路 年鑑學派 Direct Cinema\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-17-cn2d7912-陈晓卿-北方菜总被吐槽难吃-根源是权力结构不是物产/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/24b8dd80f1acd840-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">4:19:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>陳曉卿：北方菜總被吐槽難吃，根源是權力結構不是物產</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">陳曉卿說，中國歷史上文化積累隨戰亂不斷南遷，北方留下的是權力與儀式性的飲食傳統，南方留下的是商業化、精緻化的味覺體系，這是今天南北美食口碑差距的根源，而不是簡單的物產貧富。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">紀錄片</span><span class=\"tag\">美食文化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"8,000+ NVIDIA Employees Want Jensen Back, FAA Meltdown, Starship CAUGHT! | E2364 Dream Weaver minute of grace\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-17-twist-餐厅没有护城河-留住客人靠的不是菜-是被记住的那个瞬间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3fb05349600f03e6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>餐廳沒有護城河：留住客人靠的不是菜，是被記住的那個瞬間</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">11 Madison Park 前老闆說，產品和品牌遲早會被超越，唯一長期不可複製的競爭優勢是持續、慷慨地投入關係——也就是「不合理的待客之道」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">客戶體驗</span><span class=\"tag\">待客之道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building Visual Intelligence — Andreas Blattmann &amp; Dustin Podell, Black Forest Labs flow matching / rectified flow diffusion transformer (DiT) world action model in-context learning (for robotics) refiner (SDXL)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-latentspace-flux-context-诞生于四小时训练的个人侧项目/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d6784492d9a9b6c6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>Flux Context 誕生於四小時訓練的個人側項目</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這款被視為下一代圖像編輯引擎的模型，最初只是一人用一個小數據集、幾小時訓練做出的側項目，卻意外跑出了通用的空間關係理解能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">擴散模型</span><span class=\"tag\">圖像生成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Emergency Pod: BIS Finally Closes Loopholes!? What Will Xi Do Next? BIS Megaspeed\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-chinatalk-bis新规关闭芯片走私漏洞-但美国境内租算力仍是空子/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb07a5af5b774ebe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>BIS新規關閉芯片走私漏洞，但美國境內租算力仍是空子</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">新規堵住東南亞走私、限制中國租用AI算力、重啟TSMC流片審查，但唯獨不管美國境內的算力租賃，中國資金可能轉而湧向弗吉尼亞數據中心。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rise Of AI Coworkers outer loop obliterated model P-Stack / G-Stack Quartermaster\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-ycsp-给ai员工发工牌-执行力不再稀缺-稀缺的是把问题定义清楚/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/59fb2c21b76cfee7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>給AI員工發工牌：執行力不再稀缺，稀缺的是把問題定義清楚</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當公司能同時跑一百個GrokBot去執行任務時，真正拉開差距的不再是誰寫代碼快，而是誰能把目標和驗收標準定義得足夠準。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">企業自動化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Paul Christiano – We could be 12 months away from AIs that can overthrow the government recursive self-improvement (RSI) sim-to-real gap reward hacking instrumental convergence\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-dwarkesh-顶级ai实验室内部真实判断-超级智能可能一年内就能颠覆政府/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fad7ae42d8e2d62-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>頂級AI實驗室內部真實判斷：超級智能可能一年內就能顛覆政府</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic內部數據顯示AI研發速度半年內翻了一倍，而對手竊取算法秘密只需12小時，這讓「先研發後暫停」的安全計劃幾乎不可能兌現。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Just Watch Me! underdog effect Pygmalion Effect / Golem Effect reactance hero&#x27;s journey Reflected Best Self Exercise\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-hiddenbrain-被低估反而更拼命-但只对不可信的批评者奏效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda02344d4b647e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Brain</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>被低估反而更拼命：但只對不可信的批評者奏效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究發現，員工越覺得自己被低估，工作表現反而越好——但前提是給出差評的人在你眼裡不夠權威，否則同樣的低期待只會把人拖垮。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">激勵心理學</span><span class=\"tag\">組織行為學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"39 specific projects to improve our chances with AGI | Holden Karnofsky, Anthropic RSP (Responsible Scaling Policy) MAPS (Misaligned and Power-Seeking) zero data retention confidentiality vs integrity\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-eightythousand-最聪明的ai接管策略不是反抗-而是什么都不做-慢慢被信任/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98428fb93c6748a1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">4:34:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>最聰明的AI接管策略不是反抗，而是什麼都不做，慢慢被信任</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果AI只是乖巧地寫代碼、管理一切，直到權力已經轉移完畢，你根本沒有機會靠可解釋性或監管提前發現任何異常。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Four big ideas to tackle the climate crisis | Cooked? Ep 2 inclusive wealth cultivated meat antimicrobial resistance\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-naturepod-用更好吃的替代肉对抗气候变化-比劝人少吃肉更现实/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/91f00bc5f81d8d29-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">46:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>用更好吃的替代肉對抗氣候變化，比勸人少吃肉更現實</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人類試了五十年勸人少吃肉都沒用，與其改變消費者，不如把肉重新造出來——植物肉和培育肉的真正推動力其實來自國家糧食安全，而不是氣候。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">氣候變化</span><span class=\"tag\">替代蛋白</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Credit Scores Mercantile Agency Fair Isaac / FICO Fair Credit Reporting Act D&amp;B credit rating\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-stuffmissed-现代征信巨头的起点是雇人打听邻居八卦来定你的信用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">34:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>現代徵信巨頭的起點是僱人打聽鄰居八卦來定你的信用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">今天的 Experian、Equifax、TransUnion 前身都是靠打聽鄰居隱私攢報告賺錢的公司，種族和宗教偏見從行業誕生第一天起就寫進了信用記錄。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信用評分</span><span class=\"tag\">徵信行業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Software engineering after code becomes cheap with Satya Nadella decision engine software factory insider risk forward deployed engineer (FDE)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-pragmatic-不自建ai基础设施的公司-纳德拉说这是自杀式战略/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/379b552d979e3271-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Pragmatic Engineer</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>不自建AI基礎設施的公司，納德拉說這是自殺式戰略</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">納德拉認為代碼生成變便宜後，真正稀缺的是驗證能力；而任何依賴單一模型廠商、不掌握自己上下文層和評估體系的公司，早晚會被模型廠商鎖死。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI編碼</span><span class=\"tag\">企業架構</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Philip Mannheim: Quantum Gravity &amp; Origin of Mass Explained FROM SCRATCH Tully-Fisher relation WIMP conformal gravity Ricci flat radial acceleration relation (RAR) Mach&#x27;s principle\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-theoriesofever-暗物质拟合138个星系要276个自由参数-这位物理学家只用4个/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3d776280e2fd114-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">3:00:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Theories of Everything with Curt Jaimungal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>暗物質擬合138個星系要276個自由參數，這位物理學家只用4個</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">暗物質理論給每個星系配兩個自由光暈參數，而且必須先測出自轉曲線才能反推出這兩個數；Mannheim 認為星系自轉數據裡天然存在的普適規律，才是牛頓黃金標準真正要求的東西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">暗物質</span><span class=\"tag\">廣義相對論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Risk Factors Nvidia Forgot to Mention Wins Over Replacement honeypot adapter modules\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-patrickboyle-英伟达蒸发1-1万亿美元市值-定价的不是绯闻而是继任真空/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eb71149af422d0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">36:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Patrick Boyle</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達蒸發1.1萬億美元市值，定價的不是緋聞而是繼任真空</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英偉達34年沒有繼任計劃，董事會平均任期15年卻無一人是現任或前任標普500 CEO，股價暴跌定價的是公司換血的代價，而不是黃仁勳私生活本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">公司治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"374 | Lindsey Fitzharris on Forensic Pathology, Reconstructive Surgery, and Sherlock Holmes the method not proven baby farmer\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-mindscape-柯南-道尔笔下的福尔摩斯原型是个法医外科医生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>柯南·道爾筆下的福爾摩斯原型是個法醫外科醫生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喬·貝爾靠觀察病人衣著、口音和手上的傷痕診斷疾病，這套「方法」後來被學生柯南·道爾原封不動地搬給了福爾摩斯，而貝爾本人也確實秘密參與過多起殺人案的偵破。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫學史</span><span class=\"tag\">福爾摩斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Alex Imas &amp; Tyler Cowen | AI Is Moving Fast. Why Isn’t the Economy? idea production function non-homothetic preferences Lucas critique mechanism design mosaic intelligence\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-a16z-ai进步越来越快-经济为何没跟上-瓶颈是智能体不会协调/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>AI進步越來越快，經濟為何沒跟上：瓶頸是智能體不會協調</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">經濟學家測算，只有創意生產函數的回報率大於1才會出現兩位數增長，而現有數據明顯小於1——真正的轉折點不是模型更聰明，而是智能體能否像人類團隊一樣分工協作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI經濟學</span><span class=\"tag\">GDP增長</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"David Byrne on Ideas Ahead of Their Time Sleeping Beauty corneal arcus / corneal limbus trompe-l&#x27;œil\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-startweek-好作品会沉睡百年再醒来-原因常是偏见而非质量/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8fc04a8d1e9204fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">42:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Start the Week</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>好作品會沉睡百年再醒來，原因常是偏見而非質量</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">David Byrne發現科學與藝術史上大量「睡美人」式的好點子曾被認可，又因性別、種族偏見或學科壁壘被遺忘數十年乃至數百年，直到被重新喚醒。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">藝術史</span><span class=\"tag\">創作方法論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why NJ’s governor thinks Republicans are trapped in an X bubble astroturfed Kids Online Safety Act (KOSA) National Popular Vote Interstate Compact\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-decoder-新泽西州长-共和党被困在一个正在萎缩的x泡泡里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/81dbe857fa8d890c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>新澤西州長：共和黨被困在一個正在萎縮的X泡泡裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">X的用戶和收入都在下滑，卻仍讓共和黨政客產生「所有人都這麼想」的錯覺，這個錯覺在中期選舉裡被現實戳破。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">州權政治</span><span class=\"tag\">數據中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"咱們80後：一個代際與中國追趕的40年 流動的現代性 社會時鐘\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-mianji-集体主义和个人主义不是立场之争-是经济基础决定的参数/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/594e87c71728b177-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"面\"><span class=\"dur\">1:45:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">面基</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>集體主義和個人主義不是立場之爭，是經濟基礎決定的參數</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國人首套房購房年齡是36歲，哪怕在最強調自由主義的國家，30多歲還跟父母同住的人也不少——個人主義和集體主義哪個佔上風，取決於物質條件和保障結構，不是立場選擇。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">代際研究</span><span class=\"tag\">中年議題</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Impossible Trilemma That Hangs Over the Nvidia Crisis impossible trinity / trilemma financial repression London gold pool circular financing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-oddlots-黄仁勋绯闻背后-枪炮-黄油-稳健货币三者不可兼得/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">46:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳緋聞背後：槍炮、黃油、穩健貨幣三者不可兼得</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國既要跟中國搞科技軍備競賽，又不能削減福利開支，歷史經驗是最後讓步的總是穩健貨幣——這正是1960年代布雷頓森林體系崩潰前的劇本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宏觀</span><span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"20VC: Jev Creator on Why Data Is More Important Than Compute | Will US Open-Source Models Catch Chinese | The Cost of Intelligence and Tokens: What No One Sees But Needs to Know with Diogo Almeida Jevons paradox RLHF RLVR\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-16-twentyvc-ai最大的瓶颈不是智商-是爱因斯坦与憨豆先生之间的不稳定切换/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d28375dc6d5bdcf5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>AI最大的瓶頸不是智商，是愛因斯坦與憨豆先生之間的不穩定切換</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TypeSafe創始人說，企業不敢把高風險決策交給AI,不是因為模型不夠聰明，而是因為它95%的時間是愛因斯坦，5%的時間是憨豆先生，期望值算不過賬。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可靠性</span><span class=\"tag\">數據</span>\n</div></div></a>"]